## Interface: 16001
## Title: PlateIntel
## Notes: Will your DoTs kill it? Marks the damage your DoTs still have to deal on the target, focus and nameplate health bars and shows a kill icon when it is enough. Works with Blizzard, ElvUI, EllesmereUI and X-Perl frames. Also: cast damage, heals, shields and more, each switchable. /upt
## Author: Rogerio Camorim (PlateIntel); based on UsefulPlatesAndTooltips by Ironship
